WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:19.161
"Oh no!" Gasser said.

2
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.280
A broken statue lay under him.

3
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.870
"I'm sorry," Gasser said.

4
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.040
"I was looking at the dirt.

5
00:00:34.553 --> 00:00:38.794
I didn't see the statue."

6
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.561
"That's okay," Grandma said.

7
00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:50.105
"No big deal," Carlin said.

8
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.500
"There is more to see!" Grandma said.

9
00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.080
Everyone followed her.

10
00:01:05.225 --> 00:01:11.754
Smoosh!

11
00:01:11.754 --> 00:01:14.944
"Uh-oh," Poppy said.

12
00:01:14.944 --> 00:01:20.853
"Gasser ran over some flowers!"

13
00:01:20.853 --> 00:01:24.968
"Please be careful!" Dipper whispered.

14
00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:29.269
"Sorry," Gasser said.

15
00:01:29.269 --> 00:01:34.098
"Don't worry," Eddy said.

16
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.780
"We know you didn't mean to."

17
00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.819
"I like this fountain," Jeb said.

18
00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.540
"It looks like a boat."

19
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.560
"This way," Carlin said.

20
00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:54.620
Everyone followed.

21
00:01:54.621 --> 00:01:57.051
Clunk!

22
00:01:57.052 --> 00:02:02.315
"Ugh!" Gasser cried.

23
00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.630
"My tire knocked over the fountain!"

24
00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:11.060
He backed into a sign. Smash!

25
00:02:14.369 --> 00:02:17.868
"I'm too big!" Gasser cried.

26
00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.470
"I'm ruining the garden!"
